Overlay patch 0001: bump Torch's fetched spdlog to v1.15.3.
Torch standalone (TorchExternal, USE_STANDALONE=ON) FetchContents spdlog at
7e635fca (~1.12, bundled fmt 10) whose fmt fails under this Mac's clang
(macOS 27 toolchain): "call to consteval function ... is not a constant
expression" in fmt_helper.h. Upstream CI never sees it (macos-14 runners).
v1.15.3 bundles a consteval-clean fmt. Host-tool only — the torch LIBRARY
linked into the game uses find_package(spdlog) and is unaffected.

--- a/tools/Torch/CMakeLists.txt
+++ b/tools/Torch/CMakeLists.txt
@@ -227,7 +227,7 @@
 	FetchContent_Declare(
 		spdlog
 		GIT_REPOSITORY https://github.com/gabime/spdlog.git
-		GIT_TAG 7e635fca68d014934b4af8a1cf874f63989352b7
+		GIT_TAG 6fa36017cfd5731d617e1a934f0e5ea9c4445b13 # v1.15.3: old bundled fmt breaks under clang 17 consteval
 	)
 
 	FetchContent_MakeAvailable(spdlog)
